    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To compute cosine similarity between two embedded texts using an external provider, I need to choose a concrete service that offers text embedding and similarity computation. Amazon Bedrock is a suitable choice for this task as it provides access to various AI models, including those for text embedding. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service to generate embeddings for the texts and then compute the cosine similarity. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the boto3 library and the use of the 'bedrock' service. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861685119,
          "start": 1789861682045
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc11db7d001XRydlFEg33zvOB",
