        "text": "<thinking> To generate embeddings for a batch of texts, I need to use an external provider. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which is a concrete external provider that offers various AI models, including those for generating embeddings. I will import the necessary module from the boto3 library to interact with Amazon Bedrock and make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
